  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (RI21-005-01, RI21-005-02, TQRQM21174104319681 & cover letter.  Received: 09/07/2021) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No demolition or construction work shall take place on the site except between the hours of 8:00am  to 6:00pm on Mondays to Friday and 9 :00am to 1:00pm on Saturdays and none shall take place on Sundays and Public Holidays without the prior agreement of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The opening hours of the premises shall be 9:00 am to 10:00 pm on Mondays to Thursdays and 09:00 am to 11:00 pm on Fridays and Saturdays and 10:00 am to 10:00pm on Sundays and Bank Holidays.",
    "Condition : 5 - The level of noise emitted from any commercial plant installed at the premises shall not be less than 10dB(A) below the existing background noise levels (LAeq), when measured from the nearest noise sensitive receptor, over any 24 hour period in accordance with the guidance set by BS 4142:2014.",
    "Condition : 6 - The use shall not commence until refuse and recycle storage area provided within the site. The storage area and bins shall be kept permanently and no waste shall be stored outside the site. Non-recyclable  and perishable waste shall be removed from site no less frequently than once a week. Waste shall be removed as soon as the bins become full if this is earlier than the time of the normal collections, unless additional covered and enclosed bins have been provided and stored inside the building and are thereafter made permanently available for the on-site storage of refuse and waste.",
    "Condition : 7 - The ventilation flue shall be subject to regular servicing and maintenance as well as best practice shall be implemented by the proprietors. Records of such works shall be documented."
  ],
